1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:02,558
So how was paintball?
Did you have fun?

2
00:00:02,730 --> 00:00:06,650
(Sheldon:)Sure, if you consider being fragged
by your own troops fun.

3
00:00:07,401 --> 00:00:10,651
You clear a space on your calendar.
There will be an inquiry.

4
00:00:11,238 --> 00:00:12,408
(Penny:)Okay. Um...

5
00:00:12,573 --> 00:00:15,413
(Penny:)I'm having a party on Saturday,
so if you're around, come by.

6
00:00:15,576 --> 00:00:16,746
- A party?
- Yeah.

7
00:00:16,911 --> 00:00:19,831
(Howard:)A boy-girl party?

8
00:00:21,165 --> 00:00:23,245
(Penny:)There will be boys
and there will be girls...

9
00:00:23,417 --> 00:00:24,997
(Penny:)...and it is a party, so...

10
00:00:25,169 --> 00:00:28,129
Just a bunch of my friends,
have some beer, do a little dancing.

11
00:00:28,297 --> 00:00:29,427
- Dancing?
- Yeah.

12
00:00:29,590 --> 00:00:31,670
(Leonard:)- I don't know, Penny...
- Thing is, we're not...

13
00:00:31,842 --> 00:00:33,552
- We're really more of a...
- No.

14
00:00:35,054 --> 00:00:37,134
(Leonard:)But thanks.
Thanks for thinking of us.

15
00:00:37,306 --> 00:00:38,936
Are you sure? It's Halloween.

16
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,480
(Sheldon:)A Halloween party?

17
00:00:40,643 --> 00:00:42,063
(Howard:)As in costumes?

18
00:00:42,228 --> 00:00:43,608
(Penny:)Well, yeah.

19
00:00:52,404 --> 00:00:53,864
(Leonard:)Is there a theme?

20
00:00:54,031 --> 00:00:55,571
(Penny:)Um, yeah, Halloween.

21
00:00:56,367 --> 00:00:59,247
(Sheldon:)Yes, but are the costumes random
or genre-specific?

22
00:00:59,912 --> 00:01:02,542
(Penny:)As usual, I'm not following.

23
00:01:02,706 --> 00:01:05,876
(Leonard:)He's asking if we can come as anyone
from science fiction...

24
00:01:06,043 --> 00:01:07,123
(Leonard:)- ...fantasy...
- Sure.

25
00:01:07,294 --> 00:01:08,584
- Comic books?
- Fine.

26
00:01:08,754 --> 00:01:10,214
- Anime?
- Of course.

27
00:01:10,381 --> 00:01:12,801
TV, film, D&D, manga.
Greek, Roman, Norse gods...

28
00:01:12,967 --> 00:01:14,047
(Penny:)Anything you want.

29
00:01:14,218 --> 00:01:17,098
(Penny:)Okay? Any costume you want.

30
00:01:18,097 --> 00:01:20,027
(Penny:)Bye.

